# attempt, and puts the reason in the result record — the same honest
# failure 0039 chose over a silent empty channel.
#
# WHY THERE IS A DENY LIST AS WELL AS AN ALLOW LIST. This tenant runs
# as the resident and loads the resident's own ~/.claude/settings.json,
